```gitignore
# ==========================================
# ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES AND SECRETS
# ==========================================

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
commands.txt

# ==========================================
# NODE.JS / REACT / VITE FRONTEND
# ==========================================

node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/

frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/

npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Package manager and tool caches
.npm/
.yarn/cache/
.turbo/

# ==========================================
# PYTHON / FASTAPI BACKEND
# ==========================================

# Python virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
backend/.venv/
backend/venv/

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Native extensions
*.so
*.pyd

# Python build and distribution files
build/
dist/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ==========================================
# PYTHON TESTING AND QUALITY TOOLS
# ==========================================

.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.hypothesis/
.tox/
.nox/

.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
pytestdebug.log

# ==========================================
# DATABASES AND LOCAL DATA
# ==========================================

# Local SQLite databases
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# PostgreSQL local dumps and backups
*.dump
*.backup
*.bak

# Local uploads and generated document files
backend/storage/
backend/uploads/
backend/data/
uploads/

# ==========================================
# AI MODELS AND GENERATED ARTIFACTS
# ==========================================

# Large locally downloaded model files
models/
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.onnx

# Model caches
.huggingface/
.cache/huggingface/
.cache/torch/
.cache/

# Generated embeddings and vector indexes
vector_store/
chroma_db/
.faiss/

# ==========================================
# LOGS AND TEMPORARY FILES
# ==========================================

*.log
logs/
tmp/
temp/

# ==========================================
# EDITORS AND IDEs
# ==========================================

.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.code-workspace

# ==========================================
# OPERATING SYSTEM FILES
# ==========================================

.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# ==========================================
# DOCKER AND LOCAL OVERRIDES
# ==========================================

# Local-only Docker Compose overrides
docker-compose.override.yml
compose.override.yaml

# ==========================================
# OPTIONAL LOCAL CONFIGURATION
# ==========================================

# Keep example configuration files tracked.
# Real credentials and local-only configuration stay ignored.
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

### Now, fix the files Git may already have staged

**Important:** `.gitignore` does not automatically unstage files that Git has already picked up.

Run these commands in **Git Bash**, from your project root:

```bash
cd ~/Desktop/Recall
```

First, save the updated `.gitignore`, then run:

```bash
git rm -r --cached --ignore-unmatch backend/.venv
git add .gitignore
git add -A
```

This removes `backend/.venv` from Git's staging index if it was staged, but **does not delete your virtual environment from your computer**.

### Verify the result

Run:

```bash
git status --short
```

Then:

```bash
git check-ignore -v backend/.venv/Scripts/python.exe
```

The second command should show the `.gitignore` rule responsible for ignoring that Python executable.

**Stop before committing or pushing.** Send me the output of both commands so we can confirm that your virtual environment and other unnecessary files aren't included in the repository.
